# Keep each Vercel deployment small: only what the site and its /api functions need is uploaded.
# The preloaded wardrobe pictures (public/starter/made/) are not uploaded: vercel.json rewrites
# /starter/made/* to jsDelivr, which serves them from this (public) repo's main branch.
# Cloudflare (wrangler) and the local server still serve them from public/ as before.
/public/starter/made
/starter-raw
/review
/tests
/docs
/wardrobe
/scripts
/worker
/.github
